{"version":1,"title":"[BUAA OS Pre]Hello, Linux! - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\" style=\"--bg-url:url('https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUZRK.png')\"><img class=\"lazy bg\" data-src=\"https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUZRK.png\">\n  <div class=\"content\" data-text-adaptive=\"split\">\n    <div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-bottom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"menu\" href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"proj\" href=\"/posts/9dad7cb8/\">26 操作系统</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">4126 字 · 约 14 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-03-01T13:09:49.000Z\">2026-03-01</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-04-09T15:01:21.445Z\">2026-04-09</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[BUAA OS Pre]Hello, Linux!</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"序\">序</h2>\n<p>致敬传奇 OS Pre，在放假最后一天发布假期预习内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Linux-基础操作\">Linux 基础操作</h2>\n<h3 id=\"目录操作\">目录操作</h3>\n<h4 id=\"cd\">cd</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cd</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">cd</span> [选项] 目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：切换到某个目录（Change Directory）。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>Linux 的一切文件存放在根目录下。根目录用 <code>/</code> 表示。<br>\n<code>～</code> 是用户主目录的缩写。一般用户，其主目录是 <code>/home/用户名</code>，root 用户，其主目录是 <code>/root</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>$</code> 代表当前用户是一般用户，而 <code>#</code> 代表当前用户是 root 用户。</p></div></div>\n<p><code>cd</code> 支持相对路径查找。例如 <code>cd etc</code>。<br>\n<code>.</code> 表示是当前目录，<code>..</code> 表示是上一级目录。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>输入 <code>cd -</code> 可以返回上一次访问的目录。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"ls\">ls</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">ls</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">ls</span> [选项] [目录]</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：列出目录中的文件。若参数“目录”未给出，则列出当前目录中的文件。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-a              显示隐藏的文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">-l              每行只列出一个文件</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"mkdir\">mkdir</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">mkdir</span> [选项] 目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：创建一个新目录。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"rmdir\">rmdir</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">rmdir</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">rmdir</span> [选项] 目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：删除一个空的目录。请注意，只有空的目录才能被删除。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p>只有空的目录才能被删除。</p></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"文件操作\">文件操作</h3>\n<p>在 Linux 的哲学下，一切都是文件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"touch\">touch</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">touch</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">touch</span> [选项] 文件名</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：当文件存在时更新文件的时间戳，当文件不存在时创建新文件。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"rm\">rm</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">rm</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">rm</span> [选项] 文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：删除文件。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-r              递归删除目录及其内容，删除非空目录必须有此选项，否则无法删除。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-f              强制删除，不提示用户确认，忽略不存在的目录。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-i              逐一提示用户确认每个将要被删除的文件。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>这是一条很有名的指令（</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>rm -rf</code> 是十分危险的命令（尤其在 root 用户下），非必要不使用 <code>rm -rf</code> 命令，在执行之前需要再三确认。root 用户具有至高无上的权限，在该用户下执行 <code>rm -rf /</code> 可以删除一切文件，包括 Linux 本身，从而导致系统被毁灭。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 id=\"cp\">cp</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cp</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">cp</span> [选项] 源文件 目标路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：将源文件（也可以是目录）复制为目标路径对应的文件（如果目标路径是文件）或复制到目标路径（如果目标路径是目录）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-r              递归复制目录及其子目录内的所有内容。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"mv\">mv</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">mv</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：<span class=\"built_in\">mv</span> [选项] 源文件 目标路径</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：将源文件（也可以是目录）移动为目标路径对应的文件（如果目标路径是文件）或移动到目标路径（如果目标路径是目录）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-v              显示详细的操作信息。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-i              进行交互式操作，在覆盖前询问。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-u              仅在源文件较新，或目标文件不存在时，才执行移动操作。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>mv</code> 命令还可以用于移动目录，不过需要注意的是，与 <code>cp</code> 命令不同，使用 <code>mv</code> 命令移动目录时，不需要添加 <code>-r</code> 选项，它可以直接完成对目录及其子内容的移动。</p></div></div>\n<p><code>mv</code> 还可以进行重命名操作。具体来说，就是把同一个文件以不同的名字移动到当前目录下。例如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">mv</span> test.txt test2.txt</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"diff\">diff</h4>\n<p>对于<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">两个纯文本文件</mark>，使用 <code>diff</code> 进行比较。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">diff</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：diff [选项] 文件1 文件2</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-b              不检查空白字符的不同。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-B              不检查空行。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-q              仅显示有无差异，不显示详细信息。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"cat\">cat</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> [filename] <span class=\"comment\"># 显示文件内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> [filename] [filename] ... <span class=\"comment\"># 按顺序显示多个文件内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt; [filename] <span class=\"comment\"># 接受标准输入，覆盖原有内容，输入 EOF（⌃+D） 终止</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> &gt;&gt; [filename] <span class=\"comment\"># 接受标准输入，追加到末尾，输入 EOF（⌃+D） 终止</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cat</span> [filename1] &gt;&gt; [filename2] <span class=\"comment\"># 把 filename1 的内容追加到 filename2 后 </span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"chmod\">chmod</h4>\n<p>切换用户权限。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin image\"><div class=\"image-bg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1024/340;\"><img class=\"lazy\" src=\"/posts/5069adfd/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAABGdBTUEAALGPC/xhBQAAADhlWElmTU0AKgAAAAgAAYdpAAQAAAABAAAAGgAAAAAAAqACAAQAAAABAAAAAaADAAQAAAABAAAAAQAAAADa6r/EAAAAC0lEQVQIHWNgAAIAAAUAAY27m/MAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" data-src=\"https://www.runoob.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/rwx-standard-unix-permission-bits.png\" data-fancybox=\"true\"></div></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> [选项] &lt;权限模式&gt; &lt;filename&gt;    </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>权限模式可以使用字母或数字表示。</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>符号模式</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ugoa...][[+-=][rwxX]...][,...]</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>其中：</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>u</code> 表示文件<ruby>拥有者<rt>Owner</rt></ruby>，<code>g</code> 表示<ruby>用户组<rt>Group</rt></ruby>，<code>o</code> 表示<ruby>他人<rt>Others</rt></ruby>。<code>a</code> 表示三者皆是。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>+</code> 表示添加权限，<code>-</code> 表示删除权限，<code>=</code> 表示设置权限。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p><code>r</code> 表示读取权限，<code>w</code> 表示写入权限，<code>x</code> 表示执行权限，<code>X</code> 表示仅当目标文件为目录时才授予执行权限。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>数字模式</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">chmod</span> &lt;number&gt; &lt;filename&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>含义见上图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查找操作\">查找操作</h3>\n<h4 id=\"find\">find</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">find</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：find [路径] &lt;选项&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：在给定路径下递归地查找文件，输出符合要求的文件的路径。如果没有给定路径，则在当前目录下查找。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-name &lt;文件名&gt;             指定需要查找的文件名。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">find -name test.c</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"grep\">grep</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">grep</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：grep [选项] PATTERN FILE</span><br><span class=\"line\">（PATTERN是匹配字符串，FILE是文件或目录的路径）</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：输出匹配PATTERN的文件和相关的行。</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-a              不忽略二进制数据进行搜索。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-i              忽略大小写差异。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-r              从目录中递归查找。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-n              显示行号。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>grep</code> 是区分大小写的。</p></div></div>\n<p>例如查找某一目录下所有文件中含有 <code>hello</code> 的行（不区分大小写）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">grep -i -r hello</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"tree\">tree</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tree</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法: tree [选项] [目录名]</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项(常用)：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-a              列出全部文件（包含隐藏文件）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-d              只列出目录。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"man\">man</h3>\n<p>查找指令手册。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">man</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：man [选项] 命令</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：查看命令的详细说明手册。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"快捷键\">快捷键</h3>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd>：终止当前程序的运行。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Z</kbd>：挂起当前程序。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>D</kbd>：输入一个 `EOF`。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>L</kbd>：清空屏幕。相当于命令 `clear`。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>S</kbd>：暂停终端。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>D</kbd>：取消暂停终端。\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Vim\">Vim</h2>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin link dis-select\"><a class=\"link-card plain card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" title=\"简明 VIM 练级攻略\" href=\"https://coolshell.cn/articles/5426.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\" cardlink=\"\" autofill=\"icon,desc\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"title\">简明 VIM 练级攻略</span><span class=\"cap link footnote\">https://coolshell.cn/articles/5426.html</span></div><div class=\"right\"><div class=\"lazy img\" data-bg=\"https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/cdn-x/placeholder@1.0.12/link/8f277b4ee0ecd.svg\"></div></div></a></div>\n<h2 id=\"实用工具\">实用工具</h2>\n<h3 id=\"GCC\">GCC</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">gcc</span><br><span class=\"line\">用法：gcc [选项] 源代码文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">作用：编译源代码文件。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>编译生成 <code>.out</code> 文件之后就可以运行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"make-Makefile\">make &amp; Makefile</h3>\n<p>Makefile 是一个指导性的文件（文件名就为 Makefile，无后缀）。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><figcaption><span>基本格式</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">target: dependencies</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    command 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command 2</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command n</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p><code>target</code> 是构建的目标，可以是真的目标文件、可执行文件，也可以是一个标签（使用 <code>.PHONY</code> 声明一个或多个，用空格连接）。<code>dependencies</code> 是构建所需的其它文件或目标。之后的是构建所需的指令，每个 command 前必须有一个 <code>tab</code>，不能用空格。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><figcaption><span>例子</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">all: hello</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">hello: hello.c</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    gcc -o hello hello.c</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"keyword\">.PHONY</span>: clean</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">clean:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    rm -f hello.c</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\"><strong><p>提示</p>\n</strong></div><div class=\"body\"><p>Makefile 会自动找到所有需要构建的文件进行操作。首先它会构建 <code>all</code>，然后发现需要构建 <code>hello</code>，然后执行 <code>gcc -o hello hello.c</code>。</p></div></div>\n<p>之后执行 <code>make hello</code> 或是 <code>make</code>，即可产生 <code>hello</code> 这个可执行文件，使用 <code>./hello</code> 就可以执行它。值得注意的是，当执行 <code>make</code> 指令而不附加其他参数时，默认构建第一个目标。</p>\n<p>如果使用 <code>make clean</code>，总可以清除生成的 <code>hello.c</code> 文件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"Makefile-递归调用\">Makefile 递归调用</h4>\n<p>Makefile 内部可以递归调用 Makefile，比如在这样一个文件树下：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight md\"><figcaption><span>~/csc</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">.</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── code</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── fibo.c</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── main.c</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── Makefile</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── modify.sh</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── fibo</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── include</span><br><span class=\"line\">│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── fibo.h</span><br><span class=\"line\">└── Makefile</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>现在如果我需要只运行 <code>~/csc/Makefile</code> 就能编译 <code>fibo.c</code> 和 <code>main.c</code> 两个文件，除了在 Makefile 中显式指定 <code>gcc</code> 用到的源文件的路径外，还可以调用 <code>~/csc/code</code> 目录下的 Makefile。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><figcaption><span>~/csc/Makefile</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">all: fibo</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">fibo:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"variable\">$(MAKE)</span> -C ./code</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><figcaption><span>~/csc/code/Makefile</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">all:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    gcc -o fibo fibo.c main.c</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p><code>-C</code> 用于声明子目录的路径。</p>\n<h4 id=\"Makefile-变量\">Makefile 变量</h4>\n<p>Makefile 中可以使用变量，基本语法是 <code>var_name := value</code>，使用 <code>$(var_name)</code> 来访问变量。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">files := file1 file2</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">some_file: <span class=\"variable\">$(files)</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    echo <span class=\"string\">\"Creating: \"</span> <span class=\"variable\">$(files)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    touch some_file</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">file1:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    touch file1</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">file2:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    touch file2</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\"><span class=\"keyword\">.PHONY</span>: clean</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">clean:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    rm -f file1 file2 some_file</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>在 Makefile 中，所有变量都是<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">字符串</mark>类型，并且单引号和双引号<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">都没有特殊含义</mark>，作为变量的一部分给到变量。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight makefile\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">a := hello,</span><br><span class=\"line\">b := <span class=\"string\">\"world\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">c := '!'</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">all:</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    printf '<span class=\"variable\">$(a)</span>'</span><br><span class=\"line\">    printf <span class=\"variable\">$(b)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    printf <span class=\"string\">\"<span class=\"variable\">$(c)</span>\"</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>分别打印的是 <code>'hello,'</code>，<code>\"world\"</code> 和 <code>\"'!'\"</code>。<br>\n你猜对了吗（</p>\n<h3 id=\"ctags\">ctags</h3>\n<p>ctags 是一个方便代码阅读的工具，这里主要用到代码跳转功能。<br>\n首先打开 <code>~/.vimrc</code>（Vim 的配置文件），添加两行并保存：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">set tags=tags</span><br><span class=\"line\">set autochdir</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>ctags 可以实现跨文件跳转，例如首先创建一个 <code>hello.c</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><figcaption><span>hello.c</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"string\">\"test.h\"</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">void</span>)</span> {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">Pair</span> <span class=\"title\">p</span>;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    p.a = <span class=\"number\">1</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    p.b = <span class=\"number\">2</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>然后创建 <code>test.h</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c\"><figcaption><span>test.h</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"class\"><span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> <span class=\"title\">Pair</span> {</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> a;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"type\">int</span> b;</span><br><span class=\"line\">};</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>保存并退出 Vim，执行：</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin copy\"><span>BASH</span><input class=\"copy-area\" id=\"copy_9\" value=\"ctags -R *\"></div>\n<p>目录下出现了 <code>tags</code> 这个文件——符号名索引。</p>\n<p>现在使用 Vim 打开 <code>hello.c</code> 文件，将光标移动到 <code>a</code> 或 <code>b</code> 处，按下 <kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>]</kbd> 就可以跳转到结构体中 <code>a</code> 或 <code>b</code> 的定义处。再按下 <kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>o</kbd> 就可以返回跳转前的位置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tmux\">tmux</h3>\n<p>终端复用。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>输入 <code>tmux</code> 进入 tmux 的新会话。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>⇧ Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Num 5</kbd>，将窗口左右分屏。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>⇧ Shift</kbd> + <kbd>单引号</kbd>，将窗口上下分屏。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>⬆ Up</kbd> / <kbd>⬇ Down</kbd> / <kbd>⬅ Left</kbd> / <kbd>➡︎ Right</kbd>，根据方向按键来切换窗格。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>␣ Space</kbd>，切换窗格布局（上下变左右，左右变上下）。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>X</kbd>，关闭使用的窗格。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<kbd>⌃ Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>B</kbd> 然后 <kbd>D</kbd>，分离（Detach）当前会话，回到 Shell。原有的程序会保持在 tmux 会话中的状态。\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>回到会话：<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">在 Shell 下用</mark> <code>tmux ls</code> 查看当前的会话列表，记住会话名（冒号左边的数字），使用 <code>tmux a -t 会话名</code> 恢复会话。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Git\">Git</h2>\n<h3 id=\"git-restore\"><code>git restore</code></h3>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>若修改还没有进入暂存区（未 <code>git add</code>），可以使用 <code>git restore &lt;filename&gt;</code> 来撤销修改，使之退回到<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">上一个 commit</mark>的状态。若已经加入暂存区，则可以通过 <code>git restore --staged &lt;filename&gt;</code> 来取消暂存，然后再输入 <code>git restore &lt;filename&gt;</code> 来撤回更改。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Shell-脚本\">Shell 脚本</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Shell-脚本的执行\">Shell 脚本的执行</h3>\n<p>约定脚本文件以 <code>.sh</code> 结尾。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p>Linux 中没有扩展名的概念。</p></div></div>\n<p>执行时，使用 <code>./文件名</code>。<br>\n使用 <code>touch</code> 命令创建的文件默认是没有执行执行权限的，需要手动添加：</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin copy\"><span>BASH</span><input class=\"copy-area\" id=\"copy_10\" value=\"chmod +x 文件名\"></div>\n<h3 id=\"Bash-Shell-语法基础\">Bash Shell 语法基础</h3>\n<h4 id=\"Hello-world！\">Hello, world！</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>hello.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#!/bin/bash</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># My first Shell script!</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"Hello, world!\"</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>保存、修改权限、执行。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>第一行的 <code>#!</code> 称作 Shebang，当文件中存在 Shebang，程序加载器会分析其后的内容，并将这些内容作为脚本文件的解释器。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"变量\">变量</h4>\n<p>Shell 是弱类型语言，定义变量时无需指定类型。<br>\n定义变量的方法是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">var_name=value </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"orange\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p>等号两侧不允许有空格。</p></div></div>\n<p>使用 <code>$var_name</code> 或 <code>${var_name}</code> 来获取变量的值。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"blue\"><div class=\"title\"><strong><p>补充</p>\n</strong></div><div class=\"body\"><p>对于一个值是字符串的变量，Shell 提供了一种语法来进行简单处理。</p><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">a=<span class=\"string\">\"HelloWorld\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"<span class=\"variable\">${a:0:4}</span>\"</span> <span class=\"comment\"># 表示从 0 开始的 4 个字符，即 Hell</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"<span class=\"variable\">${a:4}</span>\"</span> <span class=\"comment\"># 表示从 4 开始到末尾的全部字符，即 oWorld</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"<span class=\"variable\">${a:(-2)}</span>\"</span> <span class=\"comment\"># 表示从倒数第 2 个字符到尾部的字符，即 ld</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"<span class=\"variable\">${a:4:(-2)}</span>\"</span> <span class=\"comment\"># 表示从 4 开始，并且去除尾部 2 两个字符的剩余字符，即 oWor</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\"><div class=\"cell\" style=\"\">\n    <div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"green\" child=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"body\"><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>推荐的写法</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">str=<span class=\"string\">\"Hello, world!\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"variable\">${str}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\" style=\"\">\n    <div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"red\" child=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"body\"><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>不推荐的写法</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">str=<span class=\"string\">\"Hello, world!\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"variable\">$str</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n<h4 id=\"传入参数\">传入参数</h4>\n<p>在<mark class=\"tag-plugin colorful mark\" color=\"yellow\">双引号</mark>包裹的字符串内输入 <code>$1</code>, <code>$2</code> 等等，这些变量将通过命令行来传递，例如：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>hello.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#!/bin/bash</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">str=<span class=\"string\">\"Hello, World! My name is <span class=\"variable\">$1</span>.\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"variable\">${str}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>执行命令：</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin copy\"><span>BASH</span><input class=\"copy-area\" id=\"copy_11\" value=\"./hello.sh Seym\"></div>\n<p>会看到输出 <code>Hello, World! My name is Seym.</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>第一个参量对应的变量叫 <code>$1</code>，第二个叫 <code>$2</code>，以此类推。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"条件和循环\">条件和循环</h4>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin quot p\"><p class=\"content\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"bxs:quote-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span class=\"text\">if</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"bxs:quote-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></p></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>if</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> condition1</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    command11</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command12</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ......</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> condition2</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    command21</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command22</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ......</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    command31</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command32</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ......</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>fi</code> 是 <code>if</code> 倒过来写。</p></div></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>例子</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#!/bin/bash</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ((<span class=\"variable\">$1</span> &gt; <span class=\"variable\">$2</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"first &gt; second\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ((<span class=\"variable\">$1</span> &lt; <span class=\"variable\">$2</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"second &gt; first\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> ((<span class=\"variable\">$1</span> == <span class=\"variable\">$2</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"first == second\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"Idk.\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>(())</code>是整数之间比较大小的写法，若传入字符串或浮点数是未定义行为。</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin quot p\"><p class=\"content\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"bxs:quote-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span class=\"text\">while</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"bxs:quote-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></p></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>while</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">while</span> condition</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">do</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    command1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    command2</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ...</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">done</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>其中 <code>done</code> 表示 <code>do</code> 语句块结束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"我的建议\">我的建议</h4>\n<p>对于条件语句和循环语句的 <code>condition</code>，我建议使用这样的写法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">${1}</span> -gt <span class=\"variable\">${2}</span> ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">then</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"first &gt; second\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"string\">\"second &gt; first\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">fi</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">a=1</span><br><span class=\"line\">n=10</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">while</span> [[ <span class=\"variable\">${a}</span> -le <span class=\"variable\">${n}</span> ]]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">do</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"variable\">${a}</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">let</span> a=a+1</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">done</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p>中括号和内部的内容之间<strong>必须</strong>有空格。写成 <code>[${a} -le ${n}]</code> 是错误的。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"函数\">函数</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>函数的定义方式</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"function\"><span class=\"title\">fun_name</span></span>() {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    body...</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">return</span> int_value;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>function</code> 和 <code>()</code> 二者可以省略一个。返回语句是可选的。<code>int_value</code> 是一个 <code>[0, 255]</code> 的整数，返回其他值是未定义行为。</p></div></div>\n<p>函数的调用方法如下：</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin copy\"><span>BASH</span><input class=\"copy-area\" id=\"copy_12\" value=\"func_name param1 param2 ... paramN\"></div>\n<p>第 N 个参数在函数体内用 <code>$N</code> 获取，不需要在函数开头声明。写成 <code>${N}</code> 是最好的。函数的返回值在函数调用之后用 <code>$?</code> 来获取。</p>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">提示</div><div class=\"body\"><p>使用 <code>$#</code> 来获取参数的个数，使用 <code>$*</code> 来获取所有参数。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"sed\">sed</h4>\n<p>用 <code>sed</code> 指令编辑和输出文本。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sed</span><br><span class=\"line\">sed [选项] <span class=\"string\">'命令'</span> 输入文本</span><br><span class=\"line\">选项（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">-n：安静模式，只显示经过sed处理的内容。否则显示输入文本的所有内容。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-i：直接修改读取的档案内容，而不是输出到屏幕。否则，只输出不编辑。</span><br><span class=\"line\">命令（常用）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;行号&gt;a&lt;内容&gt;： 新增，在行号后新增一行相应内容。行号可以是“数字”，在这一行之后新增，也可以是“起始行，终止行”，在其中的每一行后新增。当不写行号时，在每一行之后新增。使用$表示最后一行。后面的命令同理。</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;行号&gt;c&lt;内容&gt;：取代。用内容取代相应行的文本。</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;行号&gt;i&lt;内容&gt;：插入。在当前行的上面插入一行文本。</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;行号&gt;d：删除当前行的内容。</span><br><span class=\"line\">&lt;行号&gt;p：输出选择的内容。通常与选项-n一起使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\">s/&lt;re&gt;/&lt;string&gt;/：将&lt;re&gt;（正则表达式）匹配的内容替换为&lt;string&gt;。</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>使用例</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sed -n <span class=\"string\">'3p'</span> my.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出 my.txt 的第三行</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sed <span class=\"string\">'2d'</span> my.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 删除 my.txt 文件的第二行</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sed <span class=\"string\">'2,$d'</span> my.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 删除 my.txt 文件的第二行到最后一行</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># $ 是一个特殊符号，表示最末尾</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sed <span class=\"string\">'s/str1/str2/g'</span> my.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 在整行范围内把 str1 替换为 str2。</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 如果没有 g 标记，则只有每行第一个匹配的 str1 被替换成 str2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sed -e <span class=\"string\">'4astr '</span> -e <span class=\"string\">'s/str/aaa/'</span> my.txt</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#-e 选项允许在同一行里执行多条命令。例子的第一条是第四行后添加一个 str，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 第二个命令是将 str 替换为 aaa。命令的执行顺序对结果有影响。</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p>请注意，当不加 <code>-i</code> 选项时，只在控制台显示编辑后的文件内容，而不修改文件本身。</p></div></div>\n<h4 id=\"awk\">awk</h4>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打印整个文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">awk <span class=\"string\">'{print}'</span> &lt;filename&gt; </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 指定分隔符，打印列（指定分隔符为 ':' 然后打印其前的部分）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">awk -F <span class=\"string\">':'</span> <span class=\"string\">'{print $1}'</span> &lt;filename&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 格式化输出</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">awk <span class=\"string\">'{printf \"%-8s %-10s\\n\", $1, $2}'</span> &lt;filename&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"重定向与管道\">重定向与管道</h4>\n<p>Linux 定义了三种流，分别是：</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>标准输入 <code>stdin</code>，用 0 表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>标准输出 <code>stdout</code>，用 1 表示</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>标准错误 <code>stderr</code>，用 2 表示<br>\n覆盖原文件的重定向用 <code>&gt;</code>，追加到末尾的重定向用 <code>&gt;&gt;</code>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\"><div class=\"title\">注意</div><div class=\"body\"><p><code>&gt;</code> 是 <code>1&gt;</code> 的缩写，表示将标准输出流重定向到目标。</p></div></div>\n<p>管道符号 <code>|</code> 用于对命令进行连接。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>格式</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">command1 | command2 | command3 | ...</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>以上是将 <code>command1</code> 的输出传给 <code>command2</code> 的输入，以此类推。</p>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}